        "text": "R3 has led the enterprise blockchain space for over 10 years and has the largest live network of any TRADFI blockchain ecosystem, handling millions of transactions per day and securing tens of billions in assets each month by leading financial institutions. Solana has the highest quality tokenized assets with the largest associated demand. Our collaboration came after an exhaustive review of the market where we analyzed all major layer ones and we chose Solana for the strength and the depth of their ecosystem. This will enable native interoperability between our regulated network and a public chain, unlocking new channels for asset distribution, market access and liquidity. This is true convergence of TRADFI and DEFI that builds the first ever consensus platform on a layer 1. Bringing real world finance into decentralized future requires scale, simplicity and clear purpose, and that's why we chose Solana. Be the first to build with R3 on Solana.",
